214	  // if any operation would fail. Title conflicts are checked against the final
215	  // projected set, making swaps and release-then-reuse independent of
216	  // operation order. Each actually-changed document appends one record; a
217	  // normalized-identical replace or restore appends nothing. Returns
218	  // `{ snapshot, changed }` without persisting when `dryRun` is true or the
219	  // batch is content-preserving.
